## Agent instructions

`AGENTS.md` contains editable project defaults and points to the complete Arkoren
skill in `{{.SkillsDir}}/arkoren/`. Read its `SKILL.md` and the relevant guide/API
page before changing Arkoren code. Agent discovery varies; configure your agent
to read that path if it does not discover the skill automatically.

Commit `AGENTS.md`, the skill directory, and its `.arkoren-skill.json` manifest.
Skill management works offline and never rewrites `AGENTS.md`:

```sh
arkoren skills status --dir {{.SkillsDir}}
arkoren skills update --dir {{.SkillsDir}} --dry-run
arkoren skills update --dir {{.SkillsDir}}
```

Upgrade the CLI to get a newer bundle. Compare its API pages with the module
versions in `go.mod` before updating; local edits block replacement.
